<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000F0i5G&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1511405880000" alt="Right click on the image to save it to your computer."></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-size: 12pt;">Hi {!Case.Contact},</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666">Thank you for contacting Qantas Corporate Sales.</font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666" style=""><br></font></div><div style=""><font color="#666666"><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">The Qantas Business Direct Credit Report includes details of credits from Qantas flights purchased on&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">qantas.com</font><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">, where the ABN has been entered into the booking. Reports only includes credits for Qantas flights commencing where the Credit Voucher has been created on&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">qantas.com</span><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial;">&nbsp;via <a href="http://www.qantas.com.au/travel/airlines/your-booking/global/en"><font color="#666666">Manage Your Booking</font></a>.&nbsp;</font></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font color="#666666"><font face="arial" style="">To use a credit, go to Manage Your Booking on&nbsp;</font>qantas.com<font face="arial" style="">&nbsp;and enter your voucher reference number and last name. The voucher review page will be displayed with a Find Flights button. Click on this button to start the redemption process.&nbsp;</font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666" style="">Note: A multi city booking, round the world, points plus pay bookings and Jetstar bookings will not be eligible for voucher creation. Multiple vouchers cannot be used online, call your local <a href="http://www.qantas.com.au/travel/airlines/contacts-telephone-sales/global/en" style=""><font color="#666666">Qantas office</font></a> (13 13 13) to make the booking.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666">Please do not hesitate to contact us on 13 10 85 should you have any questions or needed further assistance.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="" color="#666666">Kind regards</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}</b></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">{!User.Title}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Qantas Corporate Sales</span></div><div><font color="#666666" face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Airways Limited</font></div></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666">A Wing, Level 4, 10 Bourke Road, Mascot NSW 2020</font></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666">P.&nbsp; 13 10 85 Ext 36</font></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666">E.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="mailto:corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au"><font color="#666666">corpsalesaus@qantas.com.au</font></a></font></span></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000F0i5L&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1511405880000" alt="Right click on the image to save it to your computer."></div></div></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><p class="MsoNormal"><b><span style="font-size: 7pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: silver;">Qantas Privacy Notice<br></span></b><span style="font-size: 7pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: silver;">Qantas collects information about you (including health information where necessary) to provide products and services to you, process your travel arrangements, facilitate your participation in the loyalty programs of Qantas and other organisations, conduct marketing activities and market research. If the information is not provided Qantas may not be able to provide the service requested. Qantas may disclose your personal information to its related companies, other carriers, travel service providers, organisations which provide services to Qantas, third parties acting on Qantas' behalf, various law enforcement agencies and governments around the world for security, customs and immigration purposes. Further details can be found in our Privacy Statement on qantas.com. You can gain access to the information Qantas holds about you by contacting Qantas Corporate Sales on 13 10 85.</span></p></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>